# D2 step 5: the on-failure destination waits for the permission that makes it work.
# Format: file | regular expression the file must contain | message if it doesn't
modules/processing/queue.tf | ^ *depends_on *= *\[ *aws_iam_role_policy\.router_data *\] *(#.*)?$ | must wait for the data permissions: depends_on = [aws_iam_role_policy.router_data], on one line
